  "name": "Issue 208: Lunar Eclipse spends its four phase stacks when the Eclipse is consumed",
  "contract": "Lunar Eclipse needs four Lunar Phase stacks to activate, but activating it keeps them. The four stacks are spent when a Lunar spell such as Moonwell Splash consumes the Eclipse; spending them on activation allowed a third back-to-back Eclipse out of eight stacks. After the Eclipse is consumed it cannot be reactivated without four new stacks.",
